# EduNova Frontend Environment Variables
# In local development: http://localhost:5000/api
# In production (Vercel/Netlify/Render): set to your deployed backend URL (e.g. https://edunova-api.onrender.com/api)
# If left empty, EduNova automatically handles fallback curriculum resolution so quizzes always work seamlessly.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5000/api

